bility, exception branches, «planned» items and states: see the notes on the last part.&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="564" y="76" width="420" height="127" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="39" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5 activity with partitions, business level) — green rounded box = action (verb + object); orange box = object node [state]; small diamond = decision (guards in brackets) or merge; black bar = fork or join; hourglass = time event; circle with a letter = connector to another part of the same figure; filled dot = start; ringed dot = activity final; circle with a cross = flow final. Dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; &quot;(… «planned»)&quot; = the step exists, that part does not." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="564" y="213" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="WF-01 Batch setup and approval (2 of 2)" id="WF_01_Batch_setup_and_approval__2_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1010" pageHeight="620" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.31 – Activity Diagram: WF-01 Create a Batch by box rows, price it and open funding&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Part 2 of 2: review and approval&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="te