xGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c13"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c12"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c14"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — Traceability: UC44, UC07, UC49, UC08 (TP2 Viên). Precondition: the Operator is approved (UC04, UC05). Exception branches: invalid dossier and revision requested (both corrected through one merge), rejection. «planned» in v1.4 (not on develop): box rows of the Batch, grouped by the row codes of the boxes, one investor per row, each row's capital at least the platform minimum contribution; the price module (a range per kg by season and Tet with a warning, never an expected return), price per kg, a floor price committed by the buyer, survival threshold with remuneration tiers, delivery radius, and locking price per kg and floor price with the Standard Cost. States: Batch Draft → PendingApproval → Draft (revision) / Rejected / Funding (Figure 4.8); Standard Cost Draft → Submitted → Locked (Figure 4.22).&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="564" y="76" width="420" height="232" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5 activity with partitions, business level) — green rounded box = action (verb + object); orange box = object node [state]; small diamond = decision (guards in brackets) or merge; black bar = fork or join; hourglass = time event; circle with a letter = connector to another part of the same figure; filled dot = start; ringed dot = activity final; circle with a cross = flow final. Dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; &quot;(… «planned»)&quot; = the step exists, that part does not." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="564" y="318" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="WF-02 Funding and contracts (1 of 3)" id="WF_02_Funding_and_contracts__1_of_3_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1030" pageHeight="780" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.32 – Activity Diagram: WF-02 Pick box rows, pay, sign and close funding&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Part 1 of 3: identity and reservation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;wh