dden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="449" y="327" width="105" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="Explore the offering: Standard Cost, price per kg, floor price, free box rows&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(prices, box rows «planned»)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="393" width="210" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.flowchart.or;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="418" y="418.5" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Accept the risk disclosure; pick free box rows (the amount is their total capital)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(box rows «planned»)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="492" width="210" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="Check limits; hold the rows 30 minutes (≤ funding deadline); issue the VietQR&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(row hold «planned»)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="325" y="591" width="210" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="A" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="416" y="690" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="430" y="195"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="[verified]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c10"><mxGeometry x="-0.7211" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="160" y="354"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="[rejected: retry or admin exception]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c11"><mxGeometry x="0.0000" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c12"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c13"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="430" y="529.5"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c14"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — Each box row goes to one investor; the amount is the total capital of the chosen rows (boxes × Standard Cost per box), so the minimum contribution is one row. Connector A continues on part 2.&lt;br&gt;Traceability, exception branches, «planned» items and states: see the notes on the last part.&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="584" y="76" width="420" height="127" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="24" v