lative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="32" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.1667;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c17"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="33" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c18"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="34" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c20"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="35" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c20"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="36" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c20" target="c21"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="37" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c21" target="c22"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="135" y="863"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="38" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c22" target="c23"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="39" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — The Batch opens when the minimum viable capital is reached AND the pre-order ratio is at least the minimum set by the Administrator; otherwise it is cancelled and investors and every depositing Customer are refunded, cancelled pre-orders included. Between the minimum and the target only the boxes of funded rows are stocked, and settlement deducts the locked Standard Cost of those boxes only. The join waits for both branches of part 2: stocking needs the capital closed and every contract FullySigned (Figure 4.8). Both refund paths end the activity, so a contract still waiting at the join is voided.&lt;br&gt;Traceability: UC02, UC09, UC11, UC10, UC14, UC12, UC40, funding close job (TP1 Thiện). Exception branches: eKYC rejected; transfer after the 30-minute hold (refunded); minimum viable capital not reached or pre-orders below the minimum ratio → Batch cancelled, refunds. «planned» in v1.4: box-row choice and row hold (one investor per row), keeping only the boxes of funded rows, price per kg and floor price on the offering, the minimum pre-order ratio in the funding-close condition (the code closes on minimum viable capital only) and refunds of Customer deposits. One payment per contribution, no instalments; UC15 Upload Offline-Signed Contract (Administrator) replaces the two e-signatures for paper signing (not drawn). Removed in v1.4 (still in code): UC13 Register Offtake Commitment. States: contribution Reserved → Confirmed / Expired / Refunded (Figure 4.9); row allocation Held → Allocated / Released «planned»; contract Draft → OperatorSigned → FullySigned / Void (4.10); payment request Pending → Paid / Expired (4.11); refund instruction Created → Succeeded / Failed (4.12); Batch Funding → capital closed / Cancelled (4.8).&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1044" y="76" width="420" height="442" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="40" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5 activity with partitions, business level) — green rounded box = action (verb + object); orange box = object node [state]; small diamond = decision (guards in brackets) or merge; black bar = fork or join; hourglass = time event; circle with a letter = connector to another part of the same figure; filled dot = start; ringed dot = activity final; circle with a cross = flow final. Dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; &quot;(… «planned»)&quot; = the step exists, that part does not." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1044" y="528" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="WF-03 Production and evidence (1 of 3)" id="WF_03_Production_and_evidence__1_of_3_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1530" pageHeight="1230" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.33 – Activity Diagram: WF-03 Production data, alerts, evidence review and milestone disbursement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Part 1 of 3: stocking, production data and alerts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="8" width="1484" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Operator" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=48;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="76" width="260" height="1117" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Platform Administrator" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=48;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="76" width="260" height="1117" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="CrabShare System" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=48;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="76" width="260" height="1117" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Farm Devices &amp;amp; Cameras (simulated) «planned»" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=48;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#64748b;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="76" width="260" height="1117" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="138" y="140" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Stock one crab per box in the funded box rows&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(box rows «planned»)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="188" width="210" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="Register the crabs per box" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="565" y="272" width="210" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="Batch [InProduction]" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7ed;strokeColor=#c2410c;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="565" y="340" width="210" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#b45309;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="655" y="412" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#334155&quot;&gt;data source?&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="689" y="400" width="105" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="Record the daily log and box events in the app (feeding, health, mortality, molting)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="473" width="210" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Post box photos, feeding records, box events and logs through the common data channel" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="825" y="466" width="210" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="657" y="565" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="Record the data per box; check mortality against the policy&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(device data «planned»)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="565" y="615" width="210" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#b45309;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="655" y="725" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#334155&quot;&gt;mortality over the limit?&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="546" y="699" width="105" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="Raise an alert with a deadline to acknowledge" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="565" y="779" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="Acknowledge the alert with a response note" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="849" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#b45309;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="655" y="945" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#334155&quot;&gt;acknowledged in time?&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="546" y="919" width="105" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="Monitor and resolve the escalated alert" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="305" y="999" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="657" y="1009" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="Issue a random capture request (one box, time window)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="565" y="1069" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="A" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x