;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c20" target="c23"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="47" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c23" target="c26"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="48" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — Evidence states (Figure 4.28): risk &lt; 20 Accepted; Watch goes straight to the Evidence Reviewer; Flagged evidence may get the Operator's explanation first; a NeedMoreEvidence verdict makes it Flagged again. The crab detection module only checks that a crab is present and adds to the risk score (develop runs a no-op detector); a person decides. Rejected evidence notifies the Operator. The Investor's view of own box details is a separate flow: it reads the accepted evidence and box data at any time. Connector B continues on part 3.&lt;br&gt;Traceability, exception branches, «planned» items and states: see the notes on the last part." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1094" y="76" width="420" height="172" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="49" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5 activity with partitions, business level) — green rounded box = action (verb + object); orange box = object node [state]; small diamond = decision (guards in brackets) or merge; black bar = fork or join; hourglass = time event; circle with a letter = connector to another part of the same figure; filled dot = start; ringed dot = activity final; circle with a cross = flow final. Dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; &quot;(… «planned»)&quot; = the step exists, that part does not." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1094" y="258" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="WF-03 Production and evidence (3 of 3)" id="WF_03_Production_and_evidence__3_of_3_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1530" pageHeight="930" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.33 – Activity Diagram: WF-03 Production data, alerts, evidence review and milestone disbursement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Part 3 of 3: milestone disbursement&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="8" width="1484" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Operator" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="76" width="260" height="815" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Platform Administrator" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="76" width="260" height="815" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="CrabShare System" style="swimlan