31" value="[need explanation]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c17"><mxGeometry x="-0.5382" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="150" y="544"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="32" value="[block]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c18"><mxGeometry x="0.0000" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="33" value="[release]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c19"><mxGeometry x="-0.7331" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="670" y="544"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="34" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c20"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="35" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="34" y="606"/><mxPoint x="34" y="189"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="36" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c21"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="670" y="724"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="37" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c21" target="c22"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="410" y="794"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="38" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c22" target="c23"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="39" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — Milestone gate (Figure 4.13): tranche 1 needs the capital closed and contracts signed; later tranches need stocking and accepted evidence since the last tranche with none flagged; tranche 3 or later needs a declared harvest date. Release creates a disbursement instruction (Figure 4.12) that the Administrator sends; after an explanation the Operator requests the tranche again (no direct release); a blocked tranche stops the later ones.&lt;br&gt;Traceability: UC17, UC52, UC19, UC20, UC45, UC47, UC48, UC21, UC53, UC18, UC40 (TP4 Khôi; ingestion and simulator TP2 Viên; disbursement TP1 Thiện). Precondition: capital closed and every contract FullySigned (WF-02); only the boxes of funded rows are stocked. Exception branches: mortality over the limit, alert not acknowledged in time (escalated), watch or flagged evidence reviewed by a person, rejected evidence, more evidence requested, tranche request refused, explanation requested, tranche blocked. «planned» in v1.4: the simulated farm devices and cameras with one common data channel, the trained crab detection module, box rows and row-scoped box details for investors. Removed in v1.4 (still in code): per-crab tags and tag photos; WaterQuality alerts with the water thresholds and readings of daily logs (pH, temperature, salinity). States: Batch Stocked → InProduction (Figure 4.8); alert Open → Acknowledged / Escalated → Resolved (4.30); capture request Open → Fulfilled / Expired (4.29); evidence Accepted / Watch / Flagged / Rejected (4.28); tranche Planned → Requested → Released / NeedsExplanation / Blocked (4.13).&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1084" y="76" width="420" height="412" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="40" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5 activity with partitions, business level) — green rounded box = action (verb + object); orange box = object node [state]; small diamond = decision (guards in brackets) or merge; black bar = fork or join; hourglass = time event; circle with a letter = connector to another part of the same figure; filled dot = start; ringed dot = activity final; circle with a cross = flow final. Dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; &quot;(… «planned»)&quot; = the step exists, that part does not." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1084" y="498" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="WF-04 Bulk pre-sale and delivery (1 of 5)" id="WF_04_Bulk_pre_sale_and_delivery__1_of_5_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1240" pageHeight="920" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.34 – Activity Diagram: WF-04 Bulk pre-order, weighed delivery, invoiced and final orders&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Part 1 of 5: pre-order and deposit (each pre-order)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="8" width="1194" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Customer" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="76" width="260" height="807" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Payment Service Provider" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="76" width="230" height="807" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="CrabShare System" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="510" y="76" width="260" height="807" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="138" y="124" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Find farms on the map that deliver to the address; choose a Batch open for pre-order" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="172" width="210" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Pre-order by number of crabs (or kg) from the minimum quantity&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(crab count, minimum «planned»)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="271" width="210" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="Check stock (no overselling) and the minimum; hold the crabs; issue the deposit VietQR&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(while funding, minimum «planned»)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="370" width="210" height="89" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#b45309;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="135" y="509" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#334155&quot;&gt;pays the deposit?&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="483" width="105" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Pay the deposit by VietQR" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="564" width="210" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="BulkPreOrder [Cancelled]: hold released, nothing lost" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7ed;strokeColor=#c2410c;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="563" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="Notify the transaction" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="633" width="210" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.flowchart.or;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="628" y="643" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="Confirm the deposit" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="701" width="210" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="BulkPreOrder [DepositPaid]" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7ed;strokeColor=#c2410c;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="769" width="210" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="A" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="626" y="829" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c9"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="640" y="308.5"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c10"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="150" y="414.5"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="[pays]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=