" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c12"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="[yes]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c14"><mxGeometry x="-0.8204" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="410" y="602"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="[no: revise]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c10"><mxGeometry x="-0.7522" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="34" y="602"/><mxPoint x="34" y="425"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c15"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — This flow runs once per Batch, separately from the flows of each pre-order (parts 1–4): the harvest per box, then, after the sales window closes, the invoiced sales (low-grade crabs and crabs of forfeited pre-orders, reasons LowGrade and ForfeitResale) and one final order to the committed buyer, never below the floor price.&lt;br&gt;Traceability: UC25, UC27, UC55, UC12, UC40, UC22, UC29, UC30, UC54, UC33, UC31, UC32, UC50, UC51 (TP3 Nhân). Exception branches: pre-order cancelled or unpaid before the deposit → nothing lost; Batch not opened → every deposit refunded, cancelled pre-orders included; cancelled after paying and the Batch opened, delivery refused or balance unpaid → deposit forfeited (UC54), and in the last two cases the crabs are resold through an invoiced sale; final-order price below the floor price → revised; return or complaint → refund, or the order completes after the return window. «planned» in v1.4: farm map with delivery radius, pre-order by crab count from a minimum while the Batch is funding (the code pre-orders by kg on a listing while InProduction), the forfeit rule on cancellation, the delivery note with the order QR, weighing at the door and the balance on weighed kg, forfeited Customer deposits, invoiced sales of low-grade or resold crabs (InvoicedSale) and the final order at the floor price; every delivered order has an invoice. Removed in v1.4 (still in code): product listings, retail cart and checkout, priority offtake claims, per-crab tags and tag-scan packing, the balance before packing (PreorderBalanceJob). States: BulkPreOrder PendingPayment (crabs held) → DepositPaid → Confirmed «planned» → Packed → Shipping → Delivered → Completed, or Cancelled, Returned, Refunded «planned», Forfeited «planned» (Figure 4.17); InvoicedSale | FinalOrder recorded with its invoice (crabs Sold), PendingPayment → Completed when the OrderPayment is paid «planned» (4.18; cancellation or expiry is an open point); complaint Open → OperatorResponded / Escalated → Resolved / Rejected (4.19).&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="564" y="76" width="420" height="502" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5 activity with partitions, business level) — green rounded box = action (verb + object); orange box = object node [state]; small diamond = decision (guards in brackets) or merge; black bar = fork or join; hourglass = time event; circle with a letter = connector to another part of the same figure; filled dot = start; ringed dot = activity final; circle with a cross = flow final. Dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; &quot;(… «planned»)&quot; = the step exists, that part does not." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="564" y="588" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="WF-05 Settlement and payout (1 of 3)" id="WF_05_Settlement_and_payout__1_of_3_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1260" pageHeight="1140" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.35 – Activity Diagram: WF-05 Settlement, tiered remuneration, payout and loss case&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Part 1 of 3: calculation and draft statement&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="8" width="1214" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Platform Administrator" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="76" width="260" height="1029" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="CrabShare System" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="76" width="510" height="1029" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="138" y="124" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Start the settlement calculation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="172" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="407" y="242" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Sum the revenue lines: delivered orders, invoiced sales, forfeited deposits, final order&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(new revenue types «planned»)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="315" y="292" width="210" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="Compute the Revenue Pool = actual revenue − locked Standard Cost of the funded boxes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="315" y="391" width="210" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#b45309;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="405" y="488" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#334155&quot;&gt;Pool &amp;gt; 0?&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="286" y="476" width="115" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Compute the remuneration: floor(Pool × rate), cut by tier below the survival threshold&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(tiers «planned»)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="315" y="542.5" width="210" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="Allocate the loss pro rata, each capped at its capital; no remuneration; the Operator bears any excess" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="555" y="542" width="210" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="Split the rest pro rata by capital, largest-remainder rounding" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="315" y="642" width="210" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="407" y="727" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="Settlement [Draft], one line per investor" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7ed;strokeColor=#c2410c;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="315" y="777" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="Review the draft statement" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="847" width="210" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#b45309;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="135" y="927" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#334155&quot;&gt;recalculate?&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="169" y="915" width="105" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="Propose the statement with a 7–14 day feedback window" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#047857;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="981" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="A" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="136" y="1051" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="[sales closed, return windows over]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.0000" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="420" y="195"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c9"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c10"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="27" value="[yes]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=