box = object node [state]; small diamond = decision (guards in brackets) or merge; black bar = fork or join; hourglass = time event; circle with a letter = connector to another part of the same figure; filled dot = start; ringed dot = activity final; circle with a cross = flow final. Dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; &quot;(… «planned»)&quot; = the step exists, that part does not." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1084" y="198" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="WF-05 Settlement and payout (3 of 3)" id="WF_05_Settlement_and_payout__3_of_3_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1270" pageHeight="680" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.35 – Activity Diagram: WF-05 Settlement, tiered remuneration, payout and loss case&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Part 3 of 3: payment instructions and payout&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="8" width="1224" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Platform Administrator" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="76" width="260" height="573" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="CrabShare System" style="swimla